{"data": {"event": {"id": "fa39e456-2609-4d55-bc2a-22316e4d9f8f", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/800/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance scientifique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fc54", "voting": null, "title": "S\u00e9ance de communications orales en imagerie ost\u00e9oarticulaire interventionnelle", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T15:00+02:00", "objectives": ["<p>1. Optimiser le guidage et le contr\u00f4le des proc\u00e9dures d\u2019ablation osseuse gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019imagerie spectrale et aux reconstructions avanc\u00e9es.&nbsp;<br>", "2. \u00c9valuer l\u2019efficacit\u00e9, la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 et l\u2019impact antalgique de nouvelles techniques de radiologie interventionnelles (\u00e9lectrochimioth\u00e9rapie).&nbsp;<br>", "3. D\u00e9montrer la faisabilit\u00e9 de gestes de r\u00e9duction, ost\u00e9osynth\u00e8se et stabilisation du bassin et du rachis r\u00e9alis\u00e9s en radiologie interventionnelle.&nbsp;<br>", "4. Discuter la place de ces techniques dans la strat\u00e9gie th\u00e9rapeutique pluridisciplinaire des m\u00e9tastases, angiomes agressifs et pathologies d\u00e9g\u00e9n\u00e9ratives.</p>", "<p>&nbsp;</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "12ce8395-2cd0-409b-937e-fb761e888ff4", "name": "253", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "44aaa8a5-cc41-403e-af07-2058808f7ccc", "title": "Dual-energy CT fusion imaging improves ice-ball visualization in bone during spinal cryoablation in porcine cadavers", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T14:09+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "75f80724-374e-446e-81f1-5f81d8a80ad0"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "83f745da-e1f6-4c0b-bea7-79e1211f0050", "lastName": "Dabli", "firstName": "Djamel", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?id